              <li><span class="changelog-tag">b98</span>Damage and debuff resists are now grouped by name in the Finder, and cards list them in the same order as the stat list. Your search is now kept when you switch tabs, and Confuse Resist has a new icon. Cost Per Level headings are larger, with spaces around the arrow.</li>
